Yes — that’s the deeper invariant.

Beverage Goblin is about connection. Communication is one of the mechanisms that enables it, but the product’s real job is connecting people to each other, to shared tastes, to discovery, to places, to memories, to rituals, and eventually to the whole beverage ecosystem.

That also makes the character better: the Goblin isn’t just “the guy who talks about drinks.” He’s the connector wandering the beverage world, finding things and bringing people together through them.